sequenceDiagram
    participant C1 as Child 1 App
    participant C2 as Child 2 App
    participant C3 as Child 3 App
    participant TP as TaskProgress Controller
    participant TPS as TaskProgress Service
    participant DB as MongoDB
    participant Socket as Socket.io
    participant P as Parent Dashboard

    Note over C1,P: Initial State: Task "inProgress", 2/3 children completed

    C3->>TP: PUT /task-progress/:taskId/status<br/>{ status: "completed" }
    activate TP
    TP->>TP: Validate Request
    TP->>TPS: updateProgressStatus(taskId, userId, "completed")
    activate TPS

    TPS->>DB: Find TaskProgress for Child 3
    activate DB
    DB-->>TPS: Progress document
    deactivate DB

    TPS->>TPS: Update status to "completed"
    TPS->>TPS: Set completedAt timestamp
    TPS->>DB: Save progress
    activate DB
    DB-->>TPS: Success
    deactivate DB

    Note over TPS: 🆕 Check if ALL children completed

    TPS->>DB: Find Task (verify collaborative)
    activate DB
    DB-->>TPS: { taskType: "collaborative" }
    deactivate DB

    TPS->>DB: Find all TaskProgress records
    activate DB
    DB-->>TPS: [Child1:completed, Child2:completed, Child3:completed]
    deactivate DB

    TPS->>TPS: Count completed: 3/3
    TPS->>TPS: ALL completed! ✅

    Note over TPS: Auto-complete parent task

    TPS->>DB: UPDATE tasks SET<br/>status="completed",<br/>completedAt=NOW()
    activate DB
    DB-->>TPS: Success
    deactivate DB

    TPS->>TPS: Invalidate Redis cache
    TPS->>Socket: emit('task:auto-completed', {...})
    activate Socket
    Socket->>P: Real-time update
    activate P
    P->>P: Refresh task status
    P-->>Socket: Acknowledged
    deactivate P
    deactivate Socket

    TPS-->>TP: Success response
    deactivate TPS
    TP-->>C3: { status: "completed",<br/>parentTaskAutoCompleted: true }
    deactivate TP

    Note over C1,P: Final State: All children completed,<br/>Parent task "completed"
